      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Coronary artery fistula involving all the 3 major coronary arteries and emptying into the left ventricle is rare. We report an asymptomatic patient with coronary artery fistula from the 3 major coronary arteries communicating with the left ventricle, who presented with a diastolic murmur at the apex."},
